File name: QUAGLOOP.MP
Path description: Quaggoths
Path starts: Bottom of Ancient Stair
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 4
Level recommendation: 25+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: quaggoth, quaggoth jald, quaggoth thonot.
Additional information:

You need to be careful of the obsidian golem moving out of it's room
and into the path. You'll need a rope and graple to get to the start
of this path from Khazarad.

Included in the zip are DMASQUAG.MP and QUAGDMAS.MP which are paths
to and from the start of this loop.

